function cirCalc(y){const c=S.cir||{},mo=m=>{let n=0;for(let k=1;k<=12;k++){const d=`${y}-${String(k).padStart(2,'0')}-15`;if(m.start<=d&&(!m.end||m.end>=d))n++}return n},auto=sum(S.team.filter(m=>m.type==='salarié'&&m.jei==='oui').map(m=>empM(m)*mo(m))),perso=c.perso!==undefined&&c.perso!==''?num(c.perso):auto,fon=perso*num(c.forfait??43)/100,base=perso+fon+num(c.amort)+num(c.brevets)+num(c.soustr),type=c.type||'cir',cap=type==='cii'?4e5:1e8,cr=type==='aucun'?0:0.30*Math.min(base,cap);return{auto,perso,fon,base,type,cr,cap}}
